        "slc_db00a2b3c30c2627d0d7b71355a062359fbd7aac7f790d166f6fe7a23b0dd3f2"
      ],
      "text": "DeerFlow (Deep Exploration and Efficient Research Flow) is an open-source super-agent harness built on LangGraph, where a lead agent orchestrates sub-agents, persistent memory, sandboxed code execution, and extensible skills/tools, isolated per conversation thread."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_15f65575ecc3b5d8090e4243a00316e6d21d32b7db1a350225f91af8884c3e75",
