        "slc_4c893935e14bf48e0cd9fbd3001fa4b07b3ef5909e38e9801b4f8284f37ce786"
      ],
      "text": "DeerFlow 2.0 is a ground-up rewrite sharing no code with the original v1 Deep Research framework, which per the French README is maintained on a separate 1.x branch."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1fde4adef3a342da1eb21e71717381f270b5654775103cfaf7b4c0be6cc7392a",
