          "repository": "bytedance/deer-flow",
          "url": "https://github.com/bytedance/deer-flow/blob/d5ae3882b6708fa9af7289a0c3c0be3eee157203/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#L28-L29"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_0c9ba14cef7135ae9b152f6cce38612e4f061712bd5a6364733ec9dd46435bc5",
        "slc_148e9541f649cccdb167182cf7983a647f04861de29458195026a09de0982ff7"
      ],
      "text": "A single make dev or Docker stack runs four services: Nginx on port 2026 as the only public entry point, a FastAPI Gateway on 8001 with an embedded LangGraph-compatible agent runtime, a Next.js frontend on 3000, and an optional provisioner on 8002 for provisioner/K8s sandbox mode."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f91e4a78e4d0705f41b18e58de2a874c5fa0cb18629194b6b9c471c53a98648e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d5ae3882b6708fa9af7289a0c3c0be3eee157203",
          "git_sha": "6bdc6b70033bdeb24e9fd35c96ec5df34687772e",
          "line_end": 47,
          "line_start": 43,
          "path": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "bytedance/deer-flow",
          "url": "https://github.com/bytedance/deer-flow/blob/d5ae3882b6708fa9af7289a0c3c0be3eee157203/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#L43-L47"
        },
        {
          "commit": "d5ae3882b6708fa9af7289a0c3c0be3eee157203",
          "git_sha": "6bdc6b70033bdeb24e9fd35c96ec5df34687772e",
          "line_end": 41,
          "line_start": 38,
          "path": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "bytedance/deer-flow",
          "url": "https://github.com/bytedance/deer-flow/blob/d5ae3882b6708fa9af7289a0c3c0be3eee157203/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#L38-L41"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_c44f90c564a448f199e259eae618740698dcac22f8e5037082ba4ff24c591ed2",
        "slc_e22d808c66d493bad5bbf3f57383a722b2c4bf6bbc6edec837cc414a9ef0915e"
      ],
      "text": "Nginx routes /api/langgraph/* to the Gateway's LangGraph-compatible runtime (rewritten to native /api/*), other /api/* paths to Gateway REST routers, and non-API paths to the frontend, so standard LangGraph SDK clients can talk to DeerFlow without a separate LangGraph server."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
