          "repository": "bytedance/deer-flow",
          "url": "https://github.com/bytedance/deer-flow/blob/d5ae3882b6708fa9af7289a0c3c0be3eee157203/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#L76-L83"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_010f3db52ec53d74be6d5b36217875ac65906df14bf673c96eedc2ebea383ebf",
        "slc_38c4edbeeedf94730e7fb3c0a1b2ffd3fb52c145aa7646c0ce1161fe24ec27a2"
      ],
      "text": "All run modes execute the agent through the Gateway via RunManager, run_agent() and StreamBridge; the lead agent is assembled by make_lead_agent() and wrapped in a middleware chain (thread data, uploads, sandbox, summarization, title, todo list, view image, clarification) that runs before the model call."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c076ce65c493b76e61e7bc0154547a5dd98b5cea7c6dd5e4fbde21c070a2ea2a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d5ae3882b6708fa9af7289a0c3c0be3eee157203",
          "git_sha": "6bdc6b70033bdeb24e9fd35c96ec5df34687772e",
          "line_end": 101,
          "line_start": 92,
          "path": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "bytedance/deer-flow",
          "url": "https://github.com/bytedance/deer-flow/blob/d5ae3882b6708fa9af7289a0c3c0be3eee157203/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#L92-L101"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_fce9cd07c857530185fb6398421b5aa038060c39adc61ab6f581afeb5ae2bd86"
      ],
      "text": "Tools come from three merged sources via get_available_tools(): built-ins (present_files, ask_clarification, view_image, review_skill_package), configured tools (bash, file operations, web search/fetch), and MCP tools; the sandbox is an abstract SandboxProvider with a dev-only LocalSandboxProvider and a Docker-based AioSandboxProvider using virtual path mapping."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_68e1f616c226e3b335ccba954f7e4cfc83c79fd8e45942c345afad9f00ae3494",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d5ae3882b6708fa9af7289a0c3c0be3eee157203",
          "git_sha": "6bdc6b70033bdeb24e9fd35c96ec5df34687772e",
          "line_end": 101,
          "line_start": 92,
          "path": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "bytedance/deer-flow",
          "url": "https://github.com/bytedance/deer-flow/blob/d5ae3882b6708fa9af7289a0c3c0be3eee157203/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#L92-L101"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_fce9cd07c857530185fb6398421b5aa038060c39adc61ab6f581afeb5ae2bd86"
      ],
      "text": "ThreadState extends LangGraph's AgentState with sandbox, artifacts, thread_data, title, todos and viewed_images, and each thread gets isolated data directories under backend/.deer-flow/threads/{thread_id}/."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
