        "slc_940e484c6c1f6f5e0df5bb072e496dd59bcf003d571857c446088a94eec51ac0"
      ],
      "text": "The frontend uses Next.js 16, React 19, TypeScript and Tailwind v4, with the LangGraph SDK for orchestration/streaming and TanStack Query for server state, requiring Node 22+ and pnpm 10.26.2+; a README badge indicates Python 3.12+ for the backend."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_890d7ab8da77cdf148b6f41fcd213b8ecb2798ee8ace0464a3b86bd6209ab9e8",
