          "url": "https://github.com/bytedance/deer-flow/blob/d5ae3882b6708fa9af7289a0c3c0be3eee157203/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#L169-L184"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_0dc919e2a6b63654f5c5af8573e3884d453999ded8b6e8a4d023140eb936fce5"
      ],
      "text": "The security model gates client-writable body.context and body.config: keys like non_interactive, disable_clarification and github_token are honored only for internally-authenticated callers, identity/sandbox fields are cleared and restamped from auth state, and nginx is the only published, loopback-by-default surface."
    },
